{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D21","page":1,"quote":"20±0.02"},{"kind":"title_block","ref":"surface_treatment","page":1,"quote":"I.Z.B.P. (TRIVALENT)"}],"comment":"Dimension D21 has a tolerance band of 0.04 mm on a part that receives zinc plating, but the drawing does not state whether the ±0.02 mm applies before or after plating. Without this allowance the plated feature may fall out of tolerance and fail to assemble. The designer should add a note clarifying whether the dimension is pre-plate or post-plate, or adjust the tolerance to account for coating thickness."
  ,
  "recommended_correction":"Add a note specifying if the 20±0.02 dimension is before or after I.Z.B.P. plating, or widen the tolerance to accommodate the plating thickness."}]}
